<body>

    <h1>My Favourites</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Favourite Book: Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone</h2>

        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=1"
             alt="Harry Potter book cover"
             width="300"
             height="200">

        <p>
            <strong>Harry Potter</strong> is my favourite book because it is full of magic and adventure.
            I <em>love</em> reading about Hogwarts and all of the amazing characters.
        </p>

        <a href="https://www.wizardingworld.com/"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer">
           Visit Wizarding World
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Favourite Drama: Snowdrop</h2>

        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=2"
